---
title: Fettuccine Alfredo
source: https://joshuaweissman.com/recipes/best-fettuccine-alfredo-recipe
author: Joshua Weissman
tags: [main course]
cuisine: Italian
---

Add @fettuccine{200 g} to a pot of salted boiling water and cook until al dente, according to package instructions.

Drain the pasta and reserve 1 cup of the pasta water.

In a saucepan over medium heat, add @{150 ml} heavy cream and @butter{55 g}. Bring to a gentle simmer, stirring occasionally for 3-4 minutes until it starts to thicken.

Turn off the heat and add @parmesan{100 g}, @fresh thyme{1 tsp}, and @minced garlic{2 cloves}.  Whisk until combined. Season with @salt and @pepper to taste.

Add the cooked fettuccine to the sauce and toss to coat. Add reserved pasta water as needed to emulsify the sauce.
